{"ref":"BDB, רְאוּבֵן","hw":"רְאוּבֵן","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְאוּבֵן</span></big><sub>71</sub>  <strong>n.pr.m. Reuben</strong>, Ρουβην[ιν] <strong>(</strong><em>behold a son!</em> but <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:32\" href=\"/Genesis.29.32\">Gn 29:32</a> makes = <span dir=\"rtl\">רָאָה בְּעָנְיִי</span>(!); Jos<sup>Ant. i, 19, 7 al.</sup> Ρουβηλος, 𝔖 <span dir=\"rtl\">ܪܘܽܒܝܺܠ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> then perhaps = Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رِيبَالٌ</span> <em>lion</em>, cf. Di<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  eldest son of Jacob and Leah <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:32\" href=\"/Genesis.29.32\">Gn 29:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:14\" href=\"/Genesis.30.14\">30:14</a> + 11 times Gn, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:2\" href=\"/Exodus.1.2\">Ex 1:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.1\">1 Ch 2:1</a>; as head of family or clan <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:14\" href=\"/Exodus.6.14\">Ex 6:14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:20\" href=\"/Numbers.1.20\">Nu 1:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:5\" href=\"/Numbers.26.5\">26:5</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.1\">1 Ch 5:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.3\">3</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי אֱלִיאָב בֶּן־רְא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.6\">Dt 11:6</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  as name of clan or tribe <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:15\" href=\"/Judges.5.15\">Ju 5:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:16\" href=\"/Judges.5.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.13\">Dt 27:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:7\" href=\"/Joshua.18.7\">Jos 18:7</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּד</span>; both D), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.6\">Dt 33:6</a> (poem), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.6\">Ez 48:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.31\">31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:5\" href=\"/Numbers.1.5\">Nu 1:5</a> (P); so <span dir=\"rtl\">מַטֵה ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:21\" href=\"/Numbers.1.21\">Nu 1:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:4\" href=\"/Numbers.13.4\">13:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 20:8\" href=\"/Joshua.20.8\">Jos 20:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:7\" href=\"/Joshua.21.7\">21:7</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:48\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.48\">1 Ch 6:48</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:63\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.63\">63</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵה ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:10\" href=\"/Numbers.2.10\">Nu 2:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:16\" href=\"/Numbers.2.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:18\" href=\"/Numbers.10.18\">10:18</a> (all P); <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי ר׳</span>, as tribe, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:1\" href=\"/Numbers.16.1\">Nu 16:1b</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:37\" href=\"/Numbers.32.37\">32:37</a> (both JE), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:10\" href=\"/Numbers.2.10\">2:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:20\" href=\"/Numbers.7.20\">7:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:5\" href=\"/Numbers.26.5\">26:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:23\" href=\"/Joshua.13.23\">Jos 13:23</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (all P), also (+ Gad and often Manasseh) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:1\" href=\"/Numbers.32.1\">Nu 32:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:2\" href=\"/Numbers.32.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:6\" href=\"/Numbers.32.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:25\" href=\"/Numbers.32.25\">25</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:12\" href=\"/Joshua.4.12\">Jos 4:12</a> (D), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:29\" href=\"/Numbers.32.29\">Nu 32:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:31\" href=\"/Numbers.32.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:33\" href=\"/Numbers.32.33\">33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:9\" href=\"/Joshua.22.9\">Jos 22:9</a> + 11 times 22 (all P), cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.18\">1 Ch 5:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶן־ר׳</span> as tribe <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:6\" href=\"/Joshua.15.6\">Jos 15:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:7\" href=\"/Joshua.18.7\">18:7</a> (both P), <span dir=\"rtl\">מַטֵּה בְּנֵי־ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:15\" href=\"/Joshua.13.15\">13:15</a> (P).","next":"BDB, רְאוּבֵנִי","prev":"BDB, רְאָיָה"}